  "prefLabel": "Puc 2002.07 ISO New England, Inc. (ISO-NE)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2002.07 “ISO New England, Inc. (ISO-NE)” means the entity serving as the regional transmission operator which oversees the operation of New England's bulk electric power generation and transmission system and administers the regional wholesale markets for electric energy and other electricity products, or its successors.\n\nSource. #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.17)",
